MalwareBazaar hash-export integration (owner-gated; no feed bundled by this change)

This repository contains optional code to process SHA-256 hash-only text
indicators from MalwareBazaar (abuse.ch / Spamhaus, https://bazaar.abuse.ch/).
It does NOT include downloaded malware samples or a MalwareBazaar indicator
list by default. After explicit source and redistribution authorization, a
signed GitHub Release MAY contain SHA-256-only derived indicators. Access to
the free community API does not itself grant commercial redistribution rights.
See docs/MALWAREBAZAAR_DB_WORKFLOW.md and the original API terms.


